From: Abel Vesa <abel.vesa@linaro.org>
Date: Fri, 8 Aug 2025 10:59:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 061/263] arm64: defconfig: Build Qualcomm SM8350 video clock
 controller as module

Signed-off-by: Neil Armstrong <neil.armstrong@linaro.org>
Signed-off-by: Abel Vesa <abel.vesa@oss.qualcomm.com>
---
 arch/arm64/configs/defconfig | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
index 6f36023a5..91f3226d9 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
@@ -1564,6 +1564,7 @@ CONFIG_SA_VIDEOCC_8775P=m
 CONFIG_SM_VIDEOCC_6350=m
 CONFIG_SM_VIDEOCC_MILOS=m
 CONFIG_SM_VIDEOCC_8250=y
+CONFIG_SM_VIDEOCC_8350=m
 CONFIG_SM_VIDEOCC_8550=m
 CONFIG_QCOM_HFPLL=y
 CONFIG_CLK_GFM_LPASS_SM8250=m
